    (property "Note" "U-REG-DAC's (LT3042) output capacitor, at OUT with OUTS Kelvin-tied to it: at least 4.7 uF, ESR under 50 mohm and ESL under 2 nH for stability [ds ADI-LT3042.pdf p.15]. 10 uF 50 V X7R in 1206 so it stays over 4.7 uF at dac-rail's DC bias. U-LVL-MOD's C-DEC-LVL takes its own branch from here, not through the DAC's pin" (at 91.44 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
