    (property "Note" "The module's own 5 V, LOGIC_5V: the SPI receiver U-RX-MOD and CS_MOD's pull-up (U-LVL-MOD is on DAC_AVDD); the bus +5 V is not used (owner, 2026-09-30). From the protected analog +12 V; EN tied to VIN; SENSE to VOUT at the part. GND on DIG_GND, the logic's return" (at 91.44 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
