    (property "Note" "SETS DAC_AVDD: I_SET (98-102 uA) x 52.3 kohm (power-entry.md, The DAC rail). Thin film +-0.1 % +-25 ppm/K, ANTI-SULFUR (ASTM B 809) - never a part without that claim. AN OPEN HERE DRIVES THE RAIL UP to ~11 V, over the DAC's 6 V abs max - accepted by the owner 2026-10-01 with no clamp, so LAYOUT: away from standoffs, connectors and board edges, its long axis parallel to the board's long edge (flex cracking is what opens a chip resistor); guard ring round SET at OUT's potential; ground end Kelvin to C-REG-OUT's" (at 294.64 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
