  (text "REPLACED 2026-10-01 (owner: a precision-set LDO, no trimmer): U-REG-DAC is the LT3042, DAC_AVDD = I_SET x R-SET-DAC with\nnothing to adjust. EN/UV and PGFB on IN, PG open, ILIM on AGND_MOD. C-SET-DAC (NP0) across R-SET-DAC; C-REG-IN and C-REG-OUT\nat its pins, OUTS Kelvin to C-REG-OUT. power-entry.md, The DAC rail" (at 254 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 71cfeb24-469d-5522-8d03-8a899922a205))
